<p>The International Criminal Court (ICC) has opened pretrial hearings in The Hague to decide whether to confirm charges against former Philippine president Rodrigo Duterte over alleged crimes against humanity tied to anti-drug campaigns. Prosecutors are pursuing three counts and say the killings of alleged drug users and dealers reached into the thousands. Duterte has long said he told police to use lethal force only in self-defense, a claim prosecutors dispute as judges begin weighing evidence and arguments at this stage.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/10P7sLaMfmkdm3spxecdwqZfDg6Q6RbT8WOeN8rY38Rby36iUIH6yd7sKJqWOh9FIr0b3WEKqAGl3NF2kA4EfrJLDgjiPD1PraHjr1oHUXkuxpnxvlWtOKddOvaqDTLOhvZf2N4hCENBnde1s5RBePiWkZOIl6S6MIp7YBJvbHw98yOOFrtVdWqm' alt='Supporters of Rodrigo Duterte outside the ICC detention center near The Hague.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Prosecutor’s claim: ICC prosecutor Mame Niang told judges the drug war led to thousands of civilian deaths, including many children, and urged the court to hold Duterte to account by sending the case to trial.</li><li>Alleged structure: Prosecutors said Duterte created, funded, and armed death squads to target alleged drug users and dealers, casting him as central to a plan to “neutralise” suspects through killings.</li><li>Alleged direction and impunity: Prosecutors argued Duterte was at the “very heart” of the campaign, including claims he helped choose targets and promised immunity for death squad members.</li><li>Attendance: Duterte will not appear at the hearing, according to reporting as proceedings got underway.</li></ul><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>ICC prosecutors: Prosecutors urged judges to confirm charges, arguing Duterte was at the center of a policy of killings and that he helped direct the campaign by selecting targets and promising protection for those carrying out attacks. (<a href='https://www.pbs.org/newshour/world/international-criminal-court-opens-hearings-into-rodrigo-duterte'>PBS NewsHour</a>, <a href='https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/feb/23/rodrigo-duterte-drug-war-case-icc-pre-trial-hearing-international-criminal-court-ntwnfb'>The Guardian</a>)</li><li>Rodrigo Duterte: Duterte has defended the crackdown, saying he instructed police to kill only in self-defense. (<a href='https://www.dawn.com/news/1975328/duterte-was-pivotal-in-murder-of-thousands-say-icc-prosecutors'>Dawn</a>)</li><li>Karapatan (human rights alliance): Cristina Palabay said outside the court that she hopes the murder and attempted-murder charges will be confirmed and Duterte’s guilt ultimately proven. (<a href='https://www.dawn.com/news/1975328/duterte-was-pivotal-in-murder-of-thousands-say-icc-prosecutors'>Dawn</a>)</li><li>Duterte supporters and opponents: Groups traveled to the Netherlands and gathered around ICC sites as hearings began, signaling both continued loyalty and demands for accountability. (<a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/02/23/world/asia/philippines-icc-duterte-supporters.html'>The New York Times</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/02/23/world/asia/philippines-icc-duterte-supporters.html'>Duterte Won’t Appear at Hearing as I.C.C. Weighs Evidence Against Him</a> - nytimes.com</li><li><a href='https://www.reddit.com/r/worldnews/comments/1rd8d51/rodrigo_duterte_exphilippine_president_faces/'>Rodrigo Duterte: Ex-Philippine president faces court for crimes against humanity</a> - reddit.com</li><li><a href='https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/c363xd6p1gxo'>Ex-Philippine president Duterte on trial for crimes against humanity: What you need to know</a> - bbc.com</li><li><a href='https://www.pbs.org/newshour/world/international-criminal-court-opens-hearings-into-rodrigo-duterte'>International Criminal Court opens hearings into Rodrigo Duterte</a> - pbs.org</li><li><a href='https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/feb/23/rodrigo-duterte-drug-war-case-icc-pre-trial-hearing-international-criminal-court-ntwnfb'>Duterte at ‘very heart’ of murderous drug crackdowns in Philippines, ICC told</a> - theguardian.com</li><li><a href='https://www.dawn.com/news/1975328/duterte-was-pivotal-in-murder-of-thousands-say-icc-prosecutors'>Duterte was ‘pivotal’ in murder of thousands, say ICC prosecutors</a> - dawn.com</li></ul>